title Observability stack
direction right

Workloads [color: gray] {
  Services [icon: server]
  Databases [icon: database]
  Kubernetes nodes [icon: kubernetes]
  Browsers [icon: browser, description: RUM]
}
Collection [color: blue] {
  OTel collector [icon: opentelemetry]
  Node exporter [icon: cpu]
  Log agent [icon: logs, description: Fluent Bit]
}
Backends [color: purple] {
  Metrics [icon: prometheus]
  Logs [icon: logs, description: Loki]
  Traces [icon: activity, description: Tempo]
  Long-term storage [icon: bucket]
}
Visualize and alert [color: orange] {
  Grafana [icon: grafana]
  Alertmanager [icon: alert]
}
On-call [icon: pagerduty, color: red]
Status page [icon: globe]

Services > OTel collector: traces, metrics
Browsers > OTel collector
Kubernetes nodes > Node exporter > Metrics
Services, Databases, Kubernetes nodes > Log agent > Logs
OTel collector > Metrics, Traces, Logs
Metrics, Logs, Traces --> Long-term storage
Metrics, Logs, Traces > Grafana
Metrics > Alertmanager > On-call
Alertmanager --> Status page
